        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ 6300V Heavy Duty Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty surface vertical rod exit device for  use on medium and high traffic commercial, hospitality, institutional applications. Suitable for all doors (aluminum, hollow metal, or wood), durable enough for the most demanding applications. Available in your choice of Satin Chrome, Satin Stainless Steel, Flat Black, or Dark Bronze finish. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor <b>30\" - 36\" Wide Doors</b>, furnished standard with wood and machine screws, optional sex bolts available. Listed for UL 305 Panic and UL 10C Fire Exit Hardware up to 3 hours. ANSI/BHMA <b>Certified Grade 1</b>, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices. Non-handed. Reversible for left or right hand doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>Meets requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>. ADA compliant and ICC/ANSI 117.1 for accessible and usable buildings. Compliant with FL #40297 +50/-50 psf 8080 18ga pair.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for PDQ 6300V Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Rail:</b> Extruded aluminum</li>\r\n<li><b>Top Latch Bolt:</b> Stainless Steel 3/4\" Toggle</li>\r\n<li><b>Bottom Latch Bolt:</b> 5/8\" Travel Drop Bolt</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Hand:</b> Device is non-handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Dogging:</b> Hex key dogging standard, cylinder dogging available</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Application:</b> Surface Vertical Rod  (7'0\" tall door standard)</li>\r\n<li><b>Stile Width:</b> 3-1/2\" minimum</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Thickness:</b> 1-3/4\"-2\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Width:</b> Standard 3'0\" door maximum</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Height:</b> Standard Up to 7' High Door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Certifications:</b> Listed for UL 305 Panic and UL 10C Fire Exit Hardware up to 3 hours. ANSI/BHMA Certified Grade 1, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices.  Meets requirements of the Buy American Act. ADA compliant and ICC/ANSI 117.1 for accessible and usable buildings. Compliant with FL #40297 +50/-50 psf 8080 18ga pair.</li>\r\n<li><b>Warranty:</b> Ten (10) year limited manufacturer warranty mechanical components</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
